#!/usr/bin/env python3

#
# Test the slingshot_switch sampler.
#
# The sampler gets its data by running the switch command `dump_counters`.
# There is no switch in the virtual cluster, so `scripts/fake_dump_counters`
# is installed as `dump_counters` on node-1. It prints synthetic values in the
# layout the sampler parses, and the test can change what it prints while
# ldmsd is running. See the script for the details.
#
# The sampler instances are loaded at run time, not from the ldmsd
# configuration file, so that a configuration that is meant to be refused does
# not prevent ldmsd from starting.
#

